#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/introduction.rst:1
msgid "What is Sibuna?"
msgstr "Sibuna とは何か"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/introduction.rst:4
msgid ""
"A passenger opens a railway timetable and asks for the next departure. We "
"run two copies of the timetable application so that one can answer while "
"the other restarts. We give passengers one public address. Sibuna listens "
"at that address, receives the request and chooses where it goes. In this "
"role it is a load balancer. It can also examine web requests and decide "
"which ones may reach the application. In that role it is a web "
"application firewall."
msgstr ""
"乗客が時刻表を開き、次の列車の発車時刻を調べます。片方が再起動しても答えられるよう、時刻表のアプリケーションは2台で動かします。乗客に知らせるアドレスは一つです。そこに届くリクエストを受け、転送先を選ぶのが "
"Sibuna です。この役割をロードバランサーといいます。Sibuna "
"はウェブリクエストの中身を調べ、どれをアプリケーションに届けるかも判断できます。これがウェブアプリケーションファイアウォールの役割です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/introduction.rst:6
msgid "One request through the edge"
msgstr "一つのリクエストの道筋"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/introduction.rst:9
msgid ""
"The browser opens an encrypted connection to the timetable's public name. "
"Sibuna presents a certificate for that name. If the browser trusts the "
"certificate, the two establish a secure connection. Sibuna can obtain and "
"renew public certificates through Let's Encrypt. For an internal service, "
"it can issue a certificate from a local authority whose root we install "
"on the clients."
msgstr ""
"ブラウザーは時刻表の公開ホスト名に暗号化接続を試みます。Sibuna "
"はその名前の証明書を提示します。ブラウザーが証明書を信頼すれば、安全な接続が成立します。Sibuna は Let's Encrypt "
"を通じて公開証明書を取得し、更新できます。内部サービスにはローカル認証局から証明書を発行し、そのルート証明書をクライアントに登録できます。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/introduction.rst:11
msgid ""
"The address where Sibuna accepts traffic is a frontend. Once Sibuna has "
"received the HTTP request, it can read the host and path. A route sends "
"timetable requests to a pool containing our two application servers. "
"These servers are the origins. For an admitted request, Sibuna chooses a "
"healthy origin from the pool, forwards the request and returns its answer "
"to the passenger."
msgstr ""
"通信を受け付けるアドレスはフロントエンドに属します。HTTP リクエストを受け取ると、Sibuna "
"はホストとパスを読めます。時刻表へのリクエストは、ルートに従って2台のアプリケーションサーバーからなるプールに向かいます。この2台がオリジンです。Sibuna "
"は通過を認めたリクエストをプール内の正常なオリジンに転送し、その応答を乗客に返します。"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/introduction.rst:14
msgid ""
"Sibuna terminates HTTPS and forwards each admitted request to one healthy "
"HTTP/1.1 origin."
msgstr "Sibuna が HTTPS を終端し、許可した各リクエストを正常な HTTP/1.1 オリジンの一方へ転送する。"

